{"text": "The second spirit was a jolly giant in a green robe, holding a glowing torch. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He took Scrooge to the small house of his clerk, Bob Cratchit. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Bob earned only fifteen shillings a week, but his family was full of joy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They shared a small goose and a pudding, and nobody said that it was small. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Bobs little son, Tiny Tim, was a weak boy who walked with a crutch. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> God bless us, every one, said Tiny Tim at the end of dinner. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Spirit, tell me if Tiny Tim will live, said Scrooge with new interest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If these shadows stay the same, the child will die, answered the spirit. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the spirit repeated Scrooges own cold words, and Scrooge hung his head in shame. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Next they visited Freds merry party, where everyone was laughing and playing games. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Fred felt sorry for his uncle, because Scrooge only hurt himself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Scrooge enjoyed the games so much that he begged to stay longer.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "s", "e", "c", "o", "n", "d", " ", "s", "p", "i", "r", "i", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "j", "o", "l", "l", "y", " ", "g", "i", "a", "n", "t", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", "g", "r", "e", "e", "n", " ", "r", "o", "b", "e", ",", " ", "h", "o", "l", "d", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", " ", "g", "l", "o", "w", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "o", "r", "c", "h", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "t", "o", "o", "k", " ", "S", "c", "r", "o", "o", "g", "e", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "m", "a", "l", "l", " ", "h", "o", "u", "s", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "c", "l", "e", "r", "k", ",", " ", "B", "o", "b", " ", "C", "r", "a", "t", "c", "h", "i", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r"